OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer hoping to 'ignite
OL,4,Asocial connections'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA photographer is hoping to "ignite
OL,7,Fcross-generational social connections"
OL,8,Fthrough telling the untold stories of a
OL,9,Fvillage's residents in a new
OL,10,Fexhibition.
OL,12,FOriginally from Leicester, Arran Patel,
OL,13,F30, has photographed 30 past and
OL,14,Fpresent residents over the age of 50
OL,15,Fwho live in Great Bedwyn near
OL,16,FMarlborough in Wiltshire for his
OL,17,Fproject.
OL,19,FPatel was inspired after watching a
OL,20,Fplay focused on learning from older
OL,21,Fgenerations.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
