OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer hoping to 'ignite
OL,4,Asocial connections'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I hope the untold stories of the
OL,7,Fpeople that form the heart and soul of
OL,8,Fthe community may ignite new social
OL,9,Fconnections, new friendships and
OL,10,Fmemories will be made," he said.
